      "document_id": "doc-917f9fcd6d2a",
      "unit_id": "unit-7f644e8b02c6",
      "text_quote": "最终要帮助老年人实现解决生活中的常见问题，提供陪伴",
      "start_offset": 8112,
      "end_offset": 8137,
      "scope": "span",
      "dimension_id": "a4_1",
      "facet_ids": [
        "a4_1_evidence"
      ],
      "extraction_note": "provider:exact:supporting",
      "support_type": "supporting",
      "source_type": "human",
      "source_label": "human_input"
    },
    {
      "span_id": "span-ext-786dc4609bf0",
      "document_id": "doc-917f9fcd6d2a",
      "unit_id": "unit-7f644e8b02c6",
      "text_quote": "因为老年人操作能力差，容易遭受危险",
      "start_offset": 7232,
      "end_offset": 7249,
      "scope": "span",
      "dimension_id": "a4_1",
      "facet_ids": [
        "a4_1_evidence"
      ],
      "extraction_note": "provider:exact:supporting",
      "support_type": "supporting",
      "source_type": "human",
      "source_label": "human_input"
    },
    {
      "span_id": "span-ext-1320a6cd438f",
      "document_id": "doc-917f9fcd6d2a",
      "unit_id": "unit-2eb1f4efef8e",
      "text_quote": "通过极致的适老化设计（语音为主、极简操作）、建立产品与用户间的情感连接（有温度的AI、主动关怀），以及提供稳定可靠的服务，持续提升老年用户的“被关心”感和生活质量。",
      "start_offset": 24626,
      "end_offset": 24708,
      "scope": "span",
      "dimension_id": "a4_1",
      "facet_ids": [
        "a4_1_evidence"
      ],
      "extraction_note": "provider:exact:supporting",
      "support_type": "supporting",
      "source_type": "unknown",
      "source_label": "expert_dialog"
    },
    {
