      "unit_id": "unit-2eb1f4efef8e",
      "text_quote": "是，因为解决了核心痛点",
      "start_offset": 26337,
      "end_offset": 26348,
      "scope": "span",
      "dimension_id": "a4_1",
      "facet_ids": [
        "a4_1_evidence"
      ],
      "extraction_note": "provider:exact:supporting",
      "support_type": "supporting",
      "source_type": "human",
      "source_label": "human_input"
    },
    {
      "span_id": "span-ext-3eab54f02ce3",
      "document_id": "doc-917f9fcd6d2a",
      "unit_id": "unit-2eb1f4efef8e",
      "text_quote": "全语音交互，极大降低老年人学习成本和使用门槛；",
      "start_offset": 44665,
      "end_offset": 44688,
      "scope": "span",
      "dimension_id": "a4_1",
      "facet_ids": [
        "a4_1_evidence"
      ],
      "extraction_note": "provider:exact:supporting",
      "support_type": "supporting",
      "source_type": "human",
      "source_label": "human_input"
    },
    {
      "span_id": "span-ext-92e9d32a082b",
      "document_id": "doc-917f9fcd6d2a",
      "unit_id": "unit-2eb1f4efef8e",
      "text_quote": "生活提醒；帮助老年人管理日常事务，解决老年人记性差的问题；",
      "start_offset": 45692,
      "end_offset": 45721,
      "scope": "span",
      "dimension_id": "a4_1",
      "facet_ids": [
        "a4_1_evidence"
      ],
      "extraction_note": "provider:exact:supporting",
      "support_type": "supporting",
      "source_type": "human",
      "source_label": "human_input"
    },
    {
      "span_id": "span-ext-c0bac9e2c328",
      "document_id": "doc-917f9fcd6d2a",
      "unit_id": "unit-a80312599d12",
      "text_quote": "AI语音聊天，解决老年人的孤独感，AI通过语调、语速判断老人情绪，并提供恰当的安慰、鼓励或推荐放松内容。允许子女预录部分语音包，定制AI的音色和常用语，让AI更像亲近的家人",
      "start_offset": 46826,
      "end_offset": 46912,
      "scope": "span",
      "dimension_id": "a4_1",
      "facet_ids": [
        "a4_1_evidence"
      ],
      "extraction_note": "provider:exact:supporting",
      "support_type": "supporting",
      "source_type": "human",
      "source_label": "human_input"
    },
    {
      "span_id": "span-ext-ba01c9db3019",
      "document_id": "doc-917f9fcd6d2a",
      "unit_id": "unit-a80312599d12",
      "text_quote": "跌倒/异常报警，通过内置传感器或联动外部设备，监测用户跌倒或长时间未动，自动发送警报。一键或语音指令快速连接预设亲属、紧急联系人或急救服务，并自动发送地理位置。",
      "start_offset": 48104,
      "end_offset": 48184,
      "scope": "span",
      "dimension_id": "a4_1",
      "facet_ids": [
        "a4_1_evidence"
      ],
      "extraction_note": "provider:exact:supporting",
      "support_type": "supporting",
      "source_type": "human",
      "source_label": "human_input"
    },
    {
      "span_id": "span-ext-90ec3a28ce37",
      "document_id": "doc-917f9fcd6d2a",
      "unit_id": "unit-5be50cb9ecd9",
      "text_quote": "回应简要介绍自己的功能？",
      "start_offset": 86343,
      "end_offset": 86355,
      "scope": "span",
      "dimension_id": "a4_1",
      "facet_ids": [
        "a4_1_evidence"
      ],
      "extraction_note": "provider:exact:supporting",
      "support_type": "supporting",
      "source_type": "human",
      "source_label": "human_input"
    },
    {
      "span_id": "span-ext-c3cbebe8f950",
      "document_id": "doc-917f9fcd6d2a",
      "unit_id": "unit-5be50cb9ecd9",
      "text_quote": "向老人询问是否喜欢乐器？",
      "start_offset": 87186,
      "end_offset": 87198,
      "scope": "span",
      "dimension_id": "a4_1",
      "facet_ids": [
        "a4_1_evidence"
      ],
      "extraction_note": "provider:exact:supporting",
      "support_type": "supporting",
      "source_type": "human",
      "source_label": "human_input"
    },
    {
      "span_id": "span-ext-09ef53478f03",
      "document_id": "doc-917f9fcd6d2a",
      "unit_id": "unit-5be50cb9ecd9",
      "text_quote": "如果说喜欢，就进一步询问老人喜欢的音乐或者乐器，",
      "start_offset": 88153,
      "end_offset": 88177,
      "scope": "span",
      "dimension_id": "a4_1",
      "facet_ids": [
        "a4_1_evidence"
      ],
      "extraction_note": "provider:exact:supporting",
      "support_type": "supporting",
      "source_type": "human",
      "source_label": "human_input"
    },
    {
      "span_id": "span-ext-70a4e3d45591",
      "document_id": "doc-917f9fcd6d2a",
      "unit_id": "unit-5be50cb9ecd9",
      "text_quote": "给出具体的音乐偏好就播放相关音乐；不喜欢音乐或乐器就询问老人的爱好",
      "start_offset": 89063,
      "end_offset": 89096,
      "scope": "span",
      "dimension_id": "a4_1",
      "facet_ids": [
        "a4_1_evidence"
      ],
      "extraction_note": "provider:exact:supporting",
      "support_type": "supporting",
      "source_type": "human",
      "source_label": "human_input"
    },
    {
      "span_id": "span-ext-18eeb8a41b75",
      "document_id": "doc-917f9fcd6d2a",
      "unit_id": "unit-5be50cb9ecd9",
